          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.36,
            0.882,
            0.395
          ],
          "content": "**Q.3. Chinu listed the various means of transport that passed across the road in front of his house from 9 am to 10 am:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.396,
            0.632,
            0.413
          ],
          "content": "**a. Prepare a frequency distribution table for the data.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.413,
            0.59,
            0.43
          ],
          "content": "**b. Which means of transport was used the most?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.431,
            0.881,
            0.467
          ],
          "content": "**c. If you were there to collect this data, how could you do it? Write the steps or process.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.482,
            0.197,
            0.497
          ],
          "content": "Ans. a."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.18,
            0.505,
            0.668,
            0.716
          ],
          "content": "| Means of Transport | Number |\n| --- | --- |\n| Bike | 13 |\n| Car | 6 |\n| Bicycle | 8 |\n| Auto Rickshaw | 8 |\n| Scooter | 9 |\n| Bus | 4 |\n| Bullock Cart | 2 |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_39_table_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.749,
            0.244,
            0.766
          ],
          "content": "b. Bike"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.768,
            0.822,
            0.785
          ],
          "content": "c. To collect the data of various means of transport, one of the ways could be –"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.215,
            0.785,
            0.881,
            0.82
          ],
          "content": "(i) Prepare a table with 2 columns. First for means of transport and second for its frequency."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.82,
            0.779,
            0.838
          ],
          "content": "(ii) List the various means of transport as they pass across the road."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.839,
            0.666,
            0.857
          ],
          "content": "(iii) Frequency should be presented using tally marks."
